              </fr:frontmatter>
              <fr:mainmatter>
                <fr:p>Some selected talks:
    
    <fr:ul><fr:li><fr:link type="local" href="dhsorens-0023.xml" addr="dhsorens-0023" title="Correct and Computable Specifications in Lean">Correct and Computable Specifications in Lean. EthCC[9], March 2026, Cannes, France.</fr:link></fr:li>
        <fr:li><fr:link type="local" href="dhsorens-0022.xml" addr="dhsorens-0022" title="Safely Snarkifying the Ethereum Protocol">Safely Snarkifying the Ethereum Protocol. EthCC[9], March 2026, Cannes, France.</fr:link></fr:li>
